  "title": "Reserve Airmen assist with Hurricane Harvey relief efforts",
  "description": "First Lt. Courtney McCallan, HH-60 Pave Hawk helicopter pilot, 920th Rescue Wing, pilots to provide rescue relief to Hurricane Harvey victims Aug. 31, 2017 near Beaumont, Texas. The 920th RQW deployed roughly 90 people, three HH-60 Pave Hawks and two HC-130Ns to College Station, Texas to support Air Force North's search and rescue mission for FEMA disaster relief. (U.S. Air Force video/Tech. Sgt. Lindsey Maurice)",
